  data: {
    LLM: "Keep a variety of numbers in your hand. Since there are no doubles, you don't have to worry about 'blocking' your own suits in the same way.\n\nHigh-Pip Management: Early in the game, try to play your 8s and 7s. If someone else dominoes, you don't want to be caught with high-counting tiles in your hand.\n\nBoneyard Counting: Since there are only 36 tiles and you know exactly which ones are missing (the doubles), you can more accurately track which tiles are left in the boneyard vs in opponents' hands.",
    Player: "Keep a variety of numbers in your hand. Since there are no doubles, you don't have to worry about 'blocking' your own suits in the same way.\n\nHigh-Pip Management: Early in the game, try to play your 8s and 7s. If someone else dominoes, you don't want to be caught with high-counting tiles in your hand.\n\nBoneyard Counting: Since there are only 36 tiles and you know exactly which ones are missing (the doubles), you can more accurately track which tiles are left in the boneyard vs in opponents' hands.",
